===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|snókr||a snake|lang=non}} or {{term|snákr||''only in poetry''; a snake|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|snakô|lang=gem-pro}}; cognates include the Danish {{term|snog||a snake|lang=da}}, English {{term|snake|lang=en}}.

